  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\left(1^2+5^2+9^2+\\ldots \\ldots \\text { upto } 20 \\text { terms }\\right)+(3+7+11+$...upto 20 terms)<br/>$\\begin{aligned}<br/>& =\\sum_{\\mathrm{r}=1}^{20}(4 \\mathrm{r}-3)^2+\\sum_{\\mathrm{r}=1}^{20}(4 \\mathrm{r}-1) \\\\\n& =\\sum_{\\mathrm{r}=1}^{20}(4 \\mathrm{r}-3)^2+(4 \\mathrm{r}-1) \\\\\n& =4 \\sum_{\\mathrm{r}=1}^{20}\\left(4 \\mathrm{r}^2-5 \\mathrm{r}+2\\right) \\\\\n& =16 \\sum_{\\mathrm{r}=1}^{20} \\mathrm{r}^2-20 \\sum_{\\mathrm{r}=1}^{20} \\mathrm{r}+8 \\sum_{\\mathrm{r}=1}^{20} 1=41880<br/>\\end{aligned}$"
  }
